msgid "Dečiji peškiri od mikrofibera, ručno rađeni, sa alkom za kačenje i preko 20 motiva. Sastavi svoj paket, plaćanje pouzećem, dostava 2–4 dana širom Srbije."
msgstr "Handmade children’s microfiber towels with a hanging loop, in over 20 designs. Build your own bundle, cash on delivery, 2–4 day shipping across Serbia."

msgid "Rezultati pretrage za „%s“."
msgstr "Search results for “%s”."

msgid "CosyPaw dečiji peškiri od mikrofibera"
msgstr "CosyPaw children’s microfiber towels"

msgid "Ručno rađeni dečiji peškiri od plišane mikrofibre, sa alkom za kačenje."
msgstr "Handmade children’s towels in plush microfiber, with a hanging loop."

msgid "Dečiji peškir od mikrofibera, motiv %s"
msgstr "Children’s microfiber towel, %s design"

msgid "O našim peškirima"
msgstr "About our towels"

msgid "Ručno rađeni peškiri za decu — i za šape"
msgstr "Handmade towels for children — and for paws"

msgid "Tražiš dečije peškire koji su mekani, upijajući i dovoljno slatki da dete samo poželi da obriše ruke? CosyPaw peškiri od mikrofibera šiju se ručno, jedan po jedan. Plišana mikrofibra je nežna prema dečijoj koži, upija u trenu, brzo se suši i ostaje meka i posle mnogo pranja."
msgstr "Looking for children’s towels that are soft, absorbent and cute enough that a child wants to dry their hands? CosyPaw microfiber towels are sewn by hand, one at a time. Plush microfiber is gentle on a child’s skin, absorbs in an instant, dries fast and stays soft wash after wash."

msgid "Svaki peškir ima alku za kačenje, pa visi na dečijoj visini — pored lavaboa, na kuki ili na vratima. Kad na kuki čeka drugar, pranje ruku postaje igra, a dete samo bira svoj peškir i samo ga koristi. Izaberi između %1$s: životinjice poput zeke, sove, pande i kapibare, zalogajčići i cvetići."
msgstr "Every towel has a hanging loop, so it hangs at a child’s height — by the sink, on a hook or on a door. When a friend is waiting on the hook, washing hands becomes a game, and the child picks and uses their own towel. Choose from %1$s: little animals like the bunny, owl, panda and capybara, treats and flowers."

msgid "%d jedinstvenih motiva"
msgstr "%d unique designs"

msgid "CosyPaw peškiri su i %1$s — za rođenje bebe, krštenje, prvi rođendan ili bebi šauer. Svaki paket stiže u CosyPaw kutiji, sa porukom dobrodošlice i mirisom lavande, a ručno rađene peškire šaljemo širom Srbije."
msgstr "CosyPaw towels are also %1$s — for a new baby, a christening, a first birthday or a baby shower. Every package arrives in a CosyPaw box, with a welcome note and a hint of lavender, and we ship our handmade towels all across Serbia."

msgid "praktičan i lep poklon"
msgstr "a practical, lovely gift"

msgid "A kako ime CosyPaw kaže, nisu samo za decu: mnogi ih drže pored vrata kao peškir za pse, za brisanje šapa posle šetnje. Mikrofibra brzo upije vlagu i blato, a peškir se pere u mašini na 40°C."
msgstr "And as the name CosyPaw says, they are not just for children: many people keep one by the door as a dog towel, for wiping paws after a walk. Microfiber soaks up damp and mud quickly, and the towel goes in the washing machine at 40°C."

msgid "Putanja"
msgstr "Breadcrumb"

msgid "Početna"
msgstr "Home"

msgid "Kolekcija"
msgstr "Collection"

msgid "Dečiji peškiri sa motivima životinja"
msgstr "Children’s towels with animal designs"

msgid "%1$d ručno rađenih peškira od mikrofibre, sa alkom za kačenje, od %2$s po komadu. Izaberi drugara za svoje dete — kupi jedan ili ih spoji u paket i uštedi."
msgstr "%1$d handmade microfiber towels with a hanging loop, from %2$s each. Pick a friend for your child — buy one, or bundle them and save."

msgid "Peškiri životinjice"
msgstr "Little animal towels"

msgid "Meki drugari koji čekaju na kuki — dete samo bira svog i raduje mu se posle svakog pranja ruku."
msgstr "Soft friends waiting on the hook — a child picks their own and looks forward to it after every hand wash."

msgid "Zalogajčići"
msgstr "Little treats"

msgid "Voće i poslastice od mikrofibre — vesela sitnica za kupatilo ili kuhinju."
msgstr "Fruit and sweets in microfiber — a cheerful little thing for the bathroom or the kitchen."

msgid "Cvetići i listići"
msgstr "Flowers and leaves"

msgid "Nežni cvetni motivi za mirniji, prirodni kutak."
msgstr "Gentle floral designs for a calmer, natural corner."

msgid "Peškiri u torbi"
msgstr "Towels in a bag"

msgid "Još peškira"
msgstr "More towels"

msgid "Zašto motivi"
msgstr "Why designs"

msgid "Dečija higijena kroz igru"
msgstr "Children’s hygiene through play"

msgid "Dečiji peškiri sa motivima životinja su mnogo više od običnog tekstila za kupatilo. Kad dete vidi omiljenog drugara kako ga čeka na kuki, baš na njegovoj visini, pranje ruku prestaje da bude obaveza i postaje igra."
msgstr "Children’s towels with animal designs are much more than ordinary bathroom textiles. When a child sees a favourite friend waiting on the hook, right at their height, washing hands stops being a chore and becomes a game."

msgid "Zato je peškir za ruke zeka jedan od najomiljenijih: mekan je, prijateljski i deca ga odmah prepoznaju. Sovica podseća na mirne večernje rutine, a panda i kapibarica unose malo smeha u svako jutro."
msgstr "That is why the bunny hand towel is one of the favourites: it is soft, friendly and children recognise it at once. The little owl is a reminder of calm evening routines, while the panda and the capybara bring a little laughter to every morning."

msgid "Svi peškiri su od plišane mikrofibre, nežne prema koži, koja se brzo suši i ostaje meka i posle mnogo pranja. Alka za kačenje drži peškir uvek nadohvat ruke, pa dete samo briše ruke i gradi higijenske navike koje ostaju. Svaki je šiven ručno, pa nema dva potpuno ista — baš kao ni dece."
msgstr "Every towel is made of plush microfiber that is gentle on skin, dries quickly and stays soft wash after wash. The hanging loop keeps the towel always within reach, so the child dries their own hands and builds hygiene habits that last. Each one is sewn by hand, so no two are exactly alike — just like children."

msgid "Kako nastaju naši %s i šta sve stiže u paketu, pročitaj na početnoj strani."
msgstr "How our %s are made, and everything that arrives in the package, is on the home page."

msgid "ručno rađeni peškiri"
msgstr "handmade towels"

msgid "Tražiš poklon za bebu ili dete? Pogledaj naše %s — spakovane u CosyPaw kutiju, spremne za predaju."
msgstr "Looking for a gift for a baby or a child? See our %s — packed in a CosyPaw box, ready to hand over."

msgid "poklon setove peškira"
msgstr "towel gift sets"

msgid "Poklon setovi peškira za decu i bebe"
msgstr "Towel gift sets for children and babies"

msgid "Pokloni"
msgstr "Gifts"

msgid "Ručno rađeni dečiji peškiri od mikrofibre, složeni u set po tvom izboru i spakovani u CosyPaw kutiju — poklon za bebu i decu koji se otvara uz osmeh i koristi svaki dan."
msgstr "Handmade children’s microfiber towels, put together into a set of your choosing and packed in a CosyPaw box — a gift for babies and children that is opened with a smile and used every day."

msgid "Poklon za svaku priliku"
msgstr "A gift for every occasion"

msgid "Za rođenje bebe"
msgstr "For a new baby"

msgid "Devojčica ili dečak — mekani drugar za dečiju sobu ili kupatilo, spreman da dočeka bebu."
msgstr "A girl or a boy — a soft friend for the nursery or the bathroom, ready to welcome the baby."

msgid "Za krštenje"
msgstr "For a christening"

msgid "Nežan poklon set za bebu koji ostaje u upotrebi i dugo posle slavlja."
msgstr "A gentle baby gift set that stays in use long after the celebration."

msgid "Za prvi rođendan"
msgstr "For a first birthday"

msgid "Peškiri koje dete prepoznaje i uz koje uči da samo briše ruke."
msgstr "Towels a child recognises, and learns to dry their own hands with."

msgid "Za bebi šauer"
msgstr "For a baby shower"

msgid "Poklon koji se otvara uz osmeh i koji roditelji zaista koriste svaki dan."
msgstr "A gift opened with a smile, that parents really do use every day."

msgid "Zašto CosyPaw poklon"
msgstr "Why a CosyPaw gift"

msgid "Unikatni pokloni za bebu i decu"
msgstr "Unique gifts for babies and children"

msgid "Pronaći unikatan poklon nije lako, ali poklon set peškira za bebu to rešava jednostavno: praktičan je, lep i pamti se. Svaki set stiže u CosyPaw kutiji, sa porukom dobrodošlice i mirisom lavande, spreman da se preda bez dodatnog pakovanja."
msgstr "Finding a unique gift is not easy, but a baby towel gift set makes it simple: it is practical, lovely and remembered. Every set arrives in a CosyPaw box, with a welcome note and a hint of lavender, ready to hand over without any extra wrapping."

msgid "Bilo da biraš poklon set za bebu za krštenje, poklon za rođenje bebe — devojčica ili dečak — ili poklone za prvi rođendan, roditelji će peškire koristiti svaki dan. Svaki put kad vide drugara na kuki, na dečijoj visini, setiće se tvog gesta. Kao poklon za baby shower naši setovi su posebno omiljeni, jer spajaju lepo i korisno."
msgstr "Whether you are choosing a baby gift set for a christening, a gift for a new baby — girl or boy — or first-birthday gifts, the parents will use the towels every day. Every time they see the friend on the hook, at a child’s height, they will remember your gesture. As a baby shower gift our sets are especially loved, because they are both lovely and useful."

msgid "dečijih peškira sa motivima životinja"
msgstr "children’s towels with animal designs"

msgid "Ako tražiš personalizovane poklone za decu, set sastavljaš sam: izaberi motive po ukusu deteta iz naše kolekcije %s, zalogajčića i cvetića."
msgstr "If you are looking for personalised gifts for children, you put the set together yourself: choose designs to the child’s taste from our collection of %s, treats and flowers."

msgid "U paketu od %1$d peškira plaćaš %2$d — pokloni za decu ne moraju biti skupi da bi bili nezaboravni."
msgstr "In a package of %1$d towels you pay for %2$d — gifts for children do not have to be expensive to be unforgettable."

msgid "Za porudžbine preko %s dostava je besplatna, a plaćaš pouzećem."
msgstr "Orders over %s ship free, and you pay cash on delivery."

msgid "Pokloni za bebu širom Srbije stižu za 2–4 radna dana. Više o tome kako nastaju CosyPaw peškiri pročitaj na %s."
msgstr "Baby gifts arrive anywhere in Serbia in 2–4 business days. Read more about how CosyPaw towels are made on the %s."

msgid "početnoj strani"
msgstr "home page"

msgid "Naruči poklon set"
msgstr "Order a gift set"

msgid "Magična krpica Avokado, limeta"
msgstr "Avocado magic cloth, lime"

msgid "Magična krpica Avokado, žalfija"
msgstr "Avocado magic cloth, sage"

msgid "Magična krpa od mikrofibera u jarkoj limeta zelenoj boji, sa vezenim avokadom. Upija vodu, hvata prašinu i briše staklo bez tragova — za kuhinju, kupatilo i ogledala."
msgstr "A microfiber magic cloth in bright lime green, with an embroidered avocado. It soaks up water, traps dust and wipes glass without streaks — for the kitchen, the bathroom and mirrors."

msgid "Magična krpa od mikrofibera u nežnoj žalfija zelenoj boji, sa vezenim nasmejanim avokadom. Upija vodu, hvata prašinu i briše staklo bez tragova — za kuhinju, kupatilo i ogledala."
msgstr "A microfiber magic cloth in soft sage green, with an embroidered smiling avocado. It soaks up water, traps dust and wipes glass without streaks — for the kitchen, the bathroom and mirrors."

msgid "Rebrasta mikrofibra upija vodu i hvata prašinu umesto da je razmazuje, pa je ista krpa jednako dobra kao kuhinjska krpa za radne površine i sudove i kao krpa za staklo, ogledala i tuš kabine. Briše bez tragova i dlačica, bez agresivnih sredstava. Višekratna je i pere se u mašini na 40°C, bez omekšivača, da zadrži upijanje — i zamenjuje gomilu papirnih ubrusa."
msgstr "Ribbed microfiber soaks up water and traps dust instead of smearing it, so the same cloth is just as good as a kitchen cloth for worktops and dishes as it is as a glass cloth for windows, mirrors and shower screens. It wipes without streaks or lint, and without harsh cleaners. It is reusable and machine-washable at 40°C, without fabric softener so it keeps absorbing — and it replaces a pile of paper towels."

msgid "Namena"
msgstr "Use"

msgid "Rebrasta mikrofibra — upija vodu i hvata prašinu."
msgstr "Ribbed microfiber — soaks up water and traps dust."

msgid "Kuhinja, staklo, ogledala, tuš kabine i radne površine."
msgstr "Kitchen, glass, mirrors, shower screens and worktops."

msgid "Mašinsko pranje na 40°C, bez omekšivača."
msgstr "Machine wash at 40°C, without fabric softener."

msgid "Dodaj %s u korpu"
msgstr "Add %s to cart"

msgid "Novo"
msgstr "New"

msgid "Magične krpice"
msgstr "Magic cloths"

msgid "Mikrofiber krpice sa vezenim avokadom — upijaju vodu, hvataju prašinu i brišu staklo bez tragova. %s po komadu, van paketa peškira."
msgstr "Microfiber cloths with an embroidered avocado — they soak up water, trap dust and wipe glass without streaks. %s each, outside the towel packages."

msgid "Sve o magičnim krpama"
msgstr "All about the magic cloths"

msgid "Set od 2 magične krpice Avokado"
msgstr "Set of 2 Avocado magic cloths"

msgid "Obe magične krpice Avokado u jednom setu — limeta i žalfija zelena. Upijaju vodu, hvataju prašinu i brišu staklo bez tragova: jedna za kuhinju, druga za staklo i ogledala."
msgstr "Both Avocado magic cloths in one set — lime and sage green. They soak up water, trap dust and wipe glass without streaks: one for the kitchen, the other for glass and mirrors."

msgid "U setu"
msgstr "In the set"

msgid "2 krpice: limeta i žalfija zelena."
msgstr "2 cloths: lime and sage green."

msgid "Uštedi %s"
msgstr "Save %s"

msgid "Pojedinačno:"
msgstr "Separately:"

msgid "Dodaj set u korpu"
msgstr "Add the set to cart"

msgid "Magične krpe"
msgstr "Magic cloths"

msgid "Magična krpa za savršeno čist dom"
msgstr "A magic cloth for a spotless home"

msgid "Mikrofiber krpa sa vezenim avokadom koja upija vodu, hvata prašinu i briše staklo bez tragova. Kuhinjska krpa i krpa za staklo u jednoj, za %s."
msgstr "A microfiber cloth with an embroidered avocado that soaks up water, traps dust and wipes glass without streaks. A kitchen cloth and a glass cloth in one, for %s."

msgid "Čišćenje bez tragova"
msgstr "Streak-free cleaning"

msgid "Kuhinjske krpe i krpe za staklo u jednoj"
msgstr "Kitchen cloths and glass cloths in one"

msgid "Želiš li da čišćenje bude brže, lakše i potpuno bez tragova? Magična krpa je upravo to. Ova mikrofiber krpa spaja mekoću, izdržljivost i praktičnost: kao kuhinjska krpa upija vodu sa radnih površina i sudova, a kao krpa za prašinu zadržava čestice umesto da ih razbacuje po vazduhu."
msgstr "Have you ever wished cleaning were quicker, easier and completely streak-free? The magic cloth is exactly that. This microfiber cloth combines softness, durability and practicality: as a kitchen cloth it soaks up water from worktops and dishes, and as a dust cloth it holds on to particles instead of scattering them into the air."

msgid "Posebno je dobra na staklu. Magične krpe za stakla ostavljaju blistav sjaj bez mrlja, tragova i dlačica, bez agresivnih hemijskih sredstava. Nisu samo za prozore: ista krpa za staklo briše ogledala u kupatilu, staklene vitrine, tuš kabine, pa i ekran televizora."
msgstr "It is especially good on glass. Magic glass cloths leave a brilliant shine with no smudges, streaks or lint, and no harsh chemicals. They are not only for windows: the same glass cloth wipes bathroom mirrors, glass cabinets, shower screens and even a TV screen."

msgid "Ako tražiš najbolju krpu za staklo, onu kakvu očekuješ od profesionalnih krpa za stakla, a da ostane i u kuhinji, ovo je ta. Krpe su višekratne, peru se u mašini na 40°C i zamenjuju gomilu papirnih ubrusa."
msgstr "If you are looking for the best glass cloth — the kind you expect from professional glass cloths, that also earns its place in the kitchen — this is it. The cloths are reusable, machine-washable at 40°C and replace a pile of paper towels."

msgid "Magične krpice šaljemo kao i %s peškire — u CosyPaw paketu, uz plaćanje pouzećem i dostavu 2–4 dana širom Srbije."
msgstr "We send the magic cloths just like %s towels — in a CosyPaw package, cash on delivery, delivered across Serbia in 2–4 days."

msgid "Dodaj ih uz paket peškira i lakše stigni do besplatne dostave preko %s."
msgstr "Add them to a towel package and reach free delivery over %s more easily."

msgid "Poruči magične krpe"
msgstr "Order magic cloths"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk Kružić, braon"
msgstr "Cuddle Puff round pillow, brown"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk Kružić, sivi"
msgstr "Cuddle Puff round pillow, grey"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk Kružić, žuti"
msgstr "Cuddle Puff round pillow, yellow"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk Kružić, zeleni"
msgstr "Cuddle Puff round pillow, green"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk Kružić, roze"
msgstr "Cuddle Puff round pillow, pink"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk Kockasti, roze"
msgstr "Cuddle Puff square pillow, pink"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk Kockasti, braon"
msgstr "Cuddle Puff square pillow, brown"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk Kockasti, sivi"
msgstr "Cuddle Puff square pillow, grey"

msgid "Mekani plišani jastuk u obliku kružića, u toploj braon boji, sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i zelenim listićem. Za stolicu, fotelju, sofu ili dečiju sobu."
msgstr "A soft, round plush pillow in warm brown, with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a green leaf. For a chair, an armchair, the sofa or a child’s room."

msgid "Mekani plišani jastuk u obliku kružića, u nežnoj sivoj boji, sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i zelenim listićem. Za stolicu, fotelju, sofu ili dečiju sobu."
msgstr "A soft, round plush pillow in gentle grey, with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a green leaf. For a chair, an armchair, the sofa or a child’s room."

msgid "Mekani plišani jastuk u obliku kružića, u veseloj žutoj boji, sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i zelenim listićem. Za stolicu, fotelju, sofu ili dečiju sobu."
msgstr "A soft, round plush pillow in cheerful yellow, with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a green leaf. For a chair, an armchair, the sofa or a child’s room."

msgid "Mekani plišani jastuk u obliku kružića, u svetloj zelenoj boji, sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i listićem. Za stolicu, fotelju, sofu ili dečiju sobu."
msgstr "A soft, round plush pillow in light green, with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a leaf. For a chair, an armchair, the sofa or a child’s room."

msgid "Mekani plišani jastuk u obliku kružića, u nežnoj roze boji, sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i zelenim listićem. Za stolicu, fotelju, sofu ili dečiju sobu."
msgstr "A soft, round plush pillow in gentle pink, with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a green leaf. For a chair, an armchair, the sofa or a child’s room."

msgid "Mekani plišani kockasti jastuk sa talasastim ivicama, u roze boji, sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i zelenim listićem. Jastuk za stolicu, fotelju ili sofu."
msgstr "A soft, square plush pillow with wavy edges in pink, with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a green leaf. A pillow for a chair, an armchair or the sofa."

msgid "Mekani plišani kockasti jastuk sa talasastim ivicama, u svetloj braon boji, sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i zelenim listićem. Jastuk za stolicu, fotelju ili sofu."
msgstr "A soft, square plush pillow with wavy edges in light brown, with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a green leaf. A pillow for a chair, an armchair or the sofa."

msgid "Mekani plišani kockasti jastuk sa talasastim ivicama, u sivoj boji, sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i zelenim listićem. Jastuk za stolicu, fotelju ili sofu."
msgstr "A soft, square plush pillow with wavy edges in grey, with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a green leaf. A pillow for a chair, an armchair or the sofa."

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuci su punašni, mekani jastuci od rebraste plišane tkanine, sa vezenim okicama, žutim kljunićem i plišanim zelenim listićem na vrhu. Talasaste ivice obrubljene su svetlom, čupavom tkaninom, a sa strane je omčica za kačenje. Jednako lepo stoje kao jastuk za stolicu ili fotelju, kao ukrasni jastuk na sofi i kao plišani drug u dečijoj sobi — i unose osmeh u svaki kutak doma."
msgstr "Cuddle Puff pillows are plump, soft pillows of ribbed plush, with embroidered eyes, a yellow beak and a plush green leaf on top. Their wavy edges are trimmed with a light, fluffy fabric, and there is a little hanging loop on the side. They look just as good as a chair or armchair cushion, as a decorative pillow on the sofa and as a plush friend in a child’s room — and they bring a smile to every corner of the home."

