msgstr "Add them to a towel package and reach free delivery over %s more easily."

msgid "Poruči dugi peškir"
msgstr "Order a long towel"

msgid "Mekani Cuddle Puff jastuci sa okicama"
msgstr "Soft Cuddle Puff pillows with little eyes"

msgid "Punašni plišani jastuci sa vezenim okicama, kljunićem i listićem, u obliku kružića ili kockasti. Za stolicu, fotelju, sofu ili dečiju sobu, za %s."
msgstr "Plump plush pillows with embroidered eyes, a little beak and a leaf, round or square. For a chair, an armchair, the sofa or a child’s room, at %s."

msgid "Jastuci za dom"
msgstr "Pillows for the home"

msgid "Jastuk za stolicu, ukrasni jastuk i plišani drug u jednom"
msgstr "A chair cushion, a decorative pillow and a plush friend in one"

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuk je onaj koji svi požele da zagrle. Rebrasta plišana tkanina mekana je na dodir, a punašni, prošiveni oblik čini ga udobnim kao jastuk za stolicu ili fotelju — u kuhinji, za radnim stolom ili u dnevnoj sobi."
msgstr "A Cuddle Puff pillow is the one everyone wants to hug. The ribbed plush is soft to the touch, and the plump, quilted shape makes it a comfortable chair or armchair cushion — in the kitchen, at the desk or in the living room."

msgid "Biraš između dva oblika. Kružić ima talasaste ivice kao cvet, a Kockasti je četvrtast, sa istim talasastim obrubom. Oba imaju vezene okice, žuti kljunić, zeleni plišani listić i omčicu za kačenje, i dolaze u nežnim bojama — od roze i žute do sive i braon."
msgstr "You choose between two shapes. The round one has wavy edges like a flower, and the square one has the same wavy trim. Both have embroidered eyes, a yellow beak, a green plush leaf and a hanging loop, and come in soft colours — from pink and yellow to grey and brown."

msgid "Kao ukrasni jastuk na sofi ili krevetu unose boju i osmeh, a u dečijoj sobi postaju plišani drug za maženje, čitanje i igru. Lepi su i kao poklon — za useljenje, rođendan ili bez povoda."
msgstr "As a decorative pillow on the sofa or bed they bring colour and a smile, and in a child’s room they become a plush friend for cuddles, reading and play. They make a lovely gift too — for a housewarming, a birthday or no reason at all."

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuke šaljemo kao i ostale CosyPaw proizvode — uz plaćanje pouzećem i dostavu 2–4 dana širom Srbije. Uz jastuk lepo idu i naši mekani proizvodi za kupatilo, poput %s."
msgstr "We send the Cuddle Puff pillows like every CosyPaw product — cash on delivery, delivered across Serbia in 2–4 days. They pair nicely with our soft bathroom pieces too, such as %s."

msgid "Cuddle Puff jastuke šaljemo kao i ostale CosyPaw proizvode — uz plaćanje pouzećem i dostavu 2–4 dana širom Srbije."
msgstr "We send the Cuddle Puff pillows like every CosyPaw product — cash on delivery, delivered across Serbia in 2–4 days."

